A dashboard is not:
❌ every chart you can make
❌ everything you calculated

A dashboard answers questions.

Your crypto dashboard must answer only these 3:

Q1️⃣ How much value is flowing through the system?

→ Total Volume

Q2️⃣ Where does that value come from?

→ Volume by Category

Q3️⃣ How risky is the flow?

→ High-Value Transaction Concentration


